{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Jmenuji se Mira. Cestou mě bolí nohy – a hlavu ještě víc. ","#","^reveal:name","/#","\n","^Slyšel jste o tom kurýrovi? Prý ho zabili Nilfgaardští. ","#","^cut","/#","\n","ev","str","^Taky jsem to četl v Hlasateli.","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Noviny lžou, co se jim hodí.","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Nevím, co si o tom myslet.","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Vidíte! Celý hřeben to ví. ","#","^aff:self:+2 ","/#","#","^aff:k2:-2","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Hm. To jste divný hostinský. ","#","^aff:self:-2 ","/#","#","^aff:k1:-1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","^Opatrný muž. To se u průsmyku cení. ","#","^aff:self:+1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["^Jdu domů, do Redanie. Tam je aspoň klid – zatím. ","#","^reveal:faction","/#","\n","ev","str","^Byla jste u průsmyku, když to stalo?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":20},"ev","str","^Šťastnou cestu, ať vás minou vojáci.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":20},"ev","str","^Nilfgaard má také své důvody.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-5","flg":20},{"c-3":["\n","^Mezi námi… já tam byla. Viděla jsem lucerny a někoho v černém. Pečeť jsem neviděla. ","#","^cut ","/#","#","^aff:self:+1 ","/#","#","^aff:k1:+1","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"told_secret","re":true},{"->":"0.g-1"},{"#f":5}],"c-4":["\n","^Děkuji. Potřebuju to slyšet. ","#","^aff:self:+2 ","/#","#","^aff:k1:+1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-1"},{"#f":5}],"c-5":["\n","^Důvody? Kurýr leží v příkopu! ","#","^aff:self:-3 ","/#","#","^aff:k2:+1 ","/#","#","^aff:k1:-1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-1"},{"#f":5}]}],"g-1":["^Jestli tu bude ten voják Bohdan, nechte mě sedět daleko. ","#","^aff:bohdan:-1","/#","\n","^On by mě hned obvinil z všeho. ","#","^cut","/#","\n","ev","str","^Tady se hosté nesoudí.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-6","flg":20},"ev","str","^Každý má svou verzi.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-7","flg":20},{"c-6":["\n","^Tak jste jediný rozumný člověk na hřebenu. ","#","^aff:self:+2 ","/#","#","^aff:k1:+1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-2"},{"#f":5}],"c-7":["\n","^I vy. Jen ať ta vaše nikoho nezabije. ","#","^aff:self:-1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-2"},{"#f":5}]}],"g-2":["^Dejte mi teplé, ať můžu dál. ","#","^bartender","/#","\n","end",["done",{"#n":"g-3"}],null]}],"done",{"global decl":["ev",false,{"VAR=":"told_secret"},"/ev","end",null]}],"listDefs":{}}